WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.525
Most foundation failures are predictable.

2
00:00:02.525 --> 00:00:07.154
A broad multifactor policy blocks
an unusual but critical sign-in,

3
00:00:07.154 --> 00:00:10.437
which is why everything
runs report-only first.

4
00:00:10.437 --> 00:00:13.476
An administrator role goes
just-in-time before the

5
00:00:13.476 --> 00:00:16.876
emergency accounts work, and
the tenant locks itself out.

6
00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:21.825
A policy aimed at a group silently misses
everyone whose attribute is empty.

7
00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:24.950
The HR feed automates
on data nobody checked.

8
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.732
And if the HR connector breaks
mid-rollout, the program stalls,

9
00:00:28.732 --> 00:00:31.475
which is why the gate
requires the feed first.

10
00:00:31.475 --> 00:00:35.060
Rollback triggers halt the
work before a problem spreads.
